@* Minimal, auth-agnostic layout for the standalone account pages (forgot / reset password).
   MainLayout wraps everything in an AuthorizeView and swaps the routed page body for the login
   modal when unauthenticated, so a logged-out user could never reach these pages under it. This
   renders @Body directly, inside the same centered card the setup wizard uses. Mirrors SetupLayout. *@
@inherits LayoutComponentBase

<div class="setup-wrap">
    <div class="setup-card">
        @Body
    </div>
</div>
